                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "q8dgta",
                          "name": "resumen",
                          "fill": "#e6e8eb",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "La tool de entrada: core.search con la consulta embebida, y cada hit recortado a su digest.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": 14.5,
                          "fontWeight": "600"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "BX0Yy",
                          "name": "contexto",
                          "fill": "#b7bec8",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "La description del decorador es lo que lee el agente y se mantiene ahí; esto es para quien mantiene la tool. Embebe la consulta con _embed_query, pasa los cuatro filtros a core.search, y reduce cada fila con _hit, que quita content y deja digest más digest_source.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "eyERY",
                          "name": "h PARÁMETROS",
                          "fill": "#8a929e",
                          "content": "PARÁMETROS",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": 11,
                          "fontWeight": "600",
                          "letterSpacing": 1
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "PMIW0",
                          "name": "params",
                          "width": "fill_container",
